{"title":"Silver Hide","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Moonhart, Glimmerfox, The Pale Hart</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pale-hart\" title=\"The Pale Hart - dropped it in 2 of 2 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e2e0b9d15c65806fed4f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Pale Hart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×5–6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"moonhart\" title=\"Moonhart - dropped it in 470 of 563 looted corpses (1/1.2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3bc9f909e37f5929cdb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonhart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–13</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"glimmerfox\" title=\"Glimmerfox - dropped it in 31 of 47 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7418be6744e1d02a8b58.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–3</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-hide\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/silverhide-feet\">Silverhide Feet</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Leatherworking